<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Tat Lee interim net up 2.67 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tat Lee interim net up 2.67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    33.97  vs   33.09</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    7.43  vs    7.37</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)  7.34  vs    6.73</p>
<p>    Net interest income		 91.54  vs   85.09</p>
<p>Income before operating</p>
<p>     expenses			    129.08  vs  124.97</p>
<p>Operating expenses and</p>
<p>     provisions			   77.79  vs   75.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			51.29  vs   49.28</p>
<p>    Tax				     15.08  vs   14.07</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (loss)  2.24  vs    2.11 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Tat Lee Bank Ltd.</p>
